2026-07-27T14:32:05.7038220Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:32:05.7038471Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:32:05.7038869Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:32:05.7039572Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:32:05.7040315Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
